Portions of secretgate's detection ruleset are derived from the Gitleaks
rule definitions (`gitleaks.toml`). Rules are converted at build time by
`scripts/sync-rules.ts` into `src/core/rules/generated.ts`; secretgate has no
runtime dependency on Gitleaks and does not bundle or invoke the Gitleaks
binary. The regular expressions and the provider taxonomy they encode remain
the work of the Gitleaks maintainers and community, and we are grateful for it.

