The baseline file format is conceptually similar to the one used by
Yelp's detect-secrets (https://github.com/Yelp/detect-secrets, Apache-2.0).
No code was copied; the idea of hashing accepted findings so brownfield repos
stay adoptable is theirs and worth crediting.
